  "modal.title": "Chiziviso",
  "modal.text": "Vashanyi vanodiwa! Skin imwe neimwe iri mugarari ino mugumisiro wemaawa akawanda ebasa. Masikini akagadzirwa nemunyori wewebhusaiti anodzivirirwa nekodzero dzemunyori: kuatarisa kunobvumidzwa, asi kuadhawunirodha, kuakopa uye kuashandisa mubhizimisi zvinoda chibvumirano chekutanga. Zvimwe zvinhu (majasi, magadzirirwo emabhuroko nemiti, nezvimwewo) ndezvevagadziri vazvo vakanyorwa mutsananguro, uye zvinoshandiswa maererano nemitemo yemarezinesi avo. Tinokutendai nekunzwisisa uye kuvimbika kwenyu! Yeukai kuti iyi haisi sevhisi yepamutemo yeMinecraft. Haina kutenderwa naMojang kana Microsoft uye haina hukama navo. Varidzi vewebhusaiti ndivo vane mutoro wayo, kwete Mojang kana Microsoft.",
